      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, right margin",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>This is the interpretation [?] of the other party, a legal acceptance with their acknowledgement of [all] this before the [lit. 'its'] witnesses and their agreement to the legal agreement. When this was completed with their testimony, as explained above, and it was certified</li>\n<li>before our lord the ..., the ..., the master, mentioned above&mdash;those mentioned above testifying for themselves according to what is attributed to them above in the text and language above, in a legal certification of attested testimony, a sound, legal certification&mdash;</li>\n<li>he ruled, may God the exalted support his judgements and favour him, according to the testimony of each of them&mdash;a sound, legal, complete, considered, satisfactory, responsible ruling</li>\n<li>on that [matter], fulfilling the written and claimed conditions and obligations of the shar\u012b\u02bfa, cognisant of the [potential for a] contradictory [ruling] on it. He bore witness his noble self to this on the 10th of Rab\u012b\u02bf I 945 [6 August 1538]&nbsp;</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 3
    },
